r"""Accounts of ERPNext's own SKR03 and SKR04 chart templates that concern the Umsatzsteuer.

Source: frappe/erpnext, branch version-16 (head 886ab6ae18 of 2026-11-17), the chart templates
erpnext/accounts/doctype/account/chart_of_accounts/verified/de_kontenplan_SKR03.json (last changed in
982810a700 of 2026-05-03) and de_kontenplan_SKR04.json (last changed in 4d75159247 of 2023-12-16).
A company set up from one of them books on these numbers, and some of them are numbers that the
DATEV editions for 2026 reserve or no longer use.

Each tuple holds, as account numbers only, every account of the template whose name matches one of
these patterns (regular expressions, case-sensitive unless marked (?i)):

    (?i)umsatzsteuer, \bU[Ss]t\b, (?i)vorsteuer, \bVorst\., UStG, (?i)steuerfrei,
    (?i)nicht steuerbar, (?i)erlöse, Erlösschmälerung, Skonti, Boni\b, Rabatte, \bKz\.,
    versteuerte Anz, innergem, \bErwerb\b, Leistungen eines, Forderungsverluste, Einfuhr,
    Dreiecksgesch, EU-Land|EU-Lieferung, Sachbezüge, Entnahme (von|durch), Unentgeltliche,
    Wertabgabe, Verwendung von Gegenständen, Provision

and none of these, which name income tax, payroll, equity or customs instead:

    lohnsteuerfrei, Rücklage, Investitionszulage, Betriebseinnahmen, § 233a AO, eigener Anteile, Zölle
"""

